{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"d84f49726c3ab5239dc1a91feb1f62d9b366ddc14dd75c6a345aed6b33e3bf9a","ja":"特別レッスンのお知らせ☆","zh":"特别训练通知☆","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a069e6d8300281904a34d81a20777d20d5995dcbb0583b63629756d164c15f64","ja":"あずささん、特別レッスンの話、聞いた～！？\nもうびっくりだよ～！","zh":"三浦あずさ，特别课程的事，你听说了吗～！？\n真是吓了我一跳～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2febcdf33bd099f212f68e3f0b2d219308c93636444716274a0b681e094baaaf","ja":"ええ！　まさか、現役コンテンポラリーダンサーさんの\n特別レッスンが受けられるなんて……！","zh":"哇！真没想到，居然能上现役当代舞者的\n特别课程……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ef1e201db685f796649b1e60ca0b94fd23488c4633fc993d6c010f5e979504bc","ja":"プロの方に見ていただけるかと思うと、\nなんだかドキドキしちゃうわ……。","zh":"一想到能让专业人士看到，\n不知为何就心跳加速呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3979bf5c332a73b4ffb86770c44fa3ec2e13e96a187926e06f01bb1836356094","ja":"私はすーっごくワクワクしてるんだっ！　だって、\n来てくれるダンサーさん、大好きな人だから！","zh":"我超级超级兴奋的！因为，\n来这里的舞者，是我最喜欢的人！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"af5e9bad52a1e88e6cf5ad984d36eddd6d32af2b7d5f3db2e6457fb8d147a5c9","ja":"どんなレッスンしてくれるんだろー？\nすっごく難しいポーズとか教えてくれないかな～♪","zh":"会教我什么样的课呢～？\n会不会教我一些超难的姿势呀～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"aab41fe365d3818970b63ce21976082e9fd90f74104130201f050d3a657b3c0e","ja":"ふふ、海美ちゃんは楽しみで仕方ないみたいね。けど、\n星梨花ちゃんとロコちゃんはとっても不安そうなの。","zh":"呵呵，小海美好像期待得不得了呢。不过，\n小星梨花和ROCO看起来非常不安。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ebd96be55cf56417cb8ddc98e5c19380773f5be28fba27fd4ef21a2e5547d877","ja":"プロの方の前で、ちゃんと踊れるかなって。\nレッスンとは思えないくらい緊張しちゃって……。","zh":"在专业人士面前，能不能好好跳舞呢。\n紧张得都不觉得这是在上课了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"54038201957f822856d2ff7df5f1095ef1765cadeaa5ca8b38c27a5be4839d07","ja":"そうなの！？　うーん。「楽しみ～！」って\n思ってくれるといいんだけどなー……。","zh":"是吗！？　唔。要是他们能觉得「好期待～！」就好了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7092aa38798ecfbc20c6ea05c7d6d3eead094000702283ef093ca0bc8904ac26","ja":"あっ！　そのダンサーさんの映像をみんなで一緒に\n見るのとかどうかな？　ファンになっちゃうくらいに！","zh":"啊！大家一起看那位舞者的影像\n怎么样？会让人变成粉丝的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2af6744a9671b4960bef9b91394b341f616427f6968158e0a37cb7070aa2da95","ja":"ダンサーさんのことが大好きになったら、\nワクワクするしかなくなるよね！","zh":"要是喜欢上了舞者，\n就只会兴奋不已了吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b2200ba2e0c44ac06630f5269e3f31b18f7ce244740c13b7fbc678942b2fd872","ja":"それはいいアイデアね♪　せっかくだから\n私もワクワクして当日を迎えたいし。","zh":"那是个好主意呢♪　难得有机会\n我也想满怀期待地迎接当天。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_954.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"6fd5da749cf9da3a9e8f769b02a629a6e791658df121fb93bcba8d257ca08360","ja":"よーしっ、じゃあ決まりだね！\nみんなで鑑賞会しよ～☆","zh":"好——，那就这么定了！\n大家一起办鉴赏会吧～☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
